# Batch files must have CRLF line endings in the working tree. cmd.exe
# mis-parses LF-only .bat files: `goto` targets stop resolving and
# multi-line `if (...)` blocks break, and rather than erroring it
# silently eats the leading characters off lines. This repo has
# core.autocrlf=input, which would otherwise check these out as LF and
# reintroduce that bug on every clone.
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Everything else keeps LF in the repo and is left alone on checkout.
* text=auto
